{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[This game is currently under development. Wishlist now to be the first notified of its release!]</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137510/extras/0fed6453463f98772d59f50039cfc6b6.avif?t=1763617381\" width=616 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Enjoy some cozy scrapbooking alongside a heartfelt story where you can...</strong></i>\u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From simple and fun puzzles to complex ones, connect the dots using context clues from different aspects of the level and create something new! &lt;3\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137510/extras/0c85e67454cec669b30735752d38791a.poster.avif?t=1763617381\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137510/extras/0c85e67454cec669b30735752d38791a.webm?t=1763617381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137510/extras/0c85e67454cec669b30735752d38791a.mp4?t=1763617381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Romance</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that will lead Belle to find the love of her life. From celebrity crushes to first loves to forever, introduce a little romance into the mix!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Scrapbooking\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As it says on the tin. Have fun letting your creativity fly by making different scrapbook spreads per themed level as you listen to some 